DEFINITIONS
================================================================================

"The Mod"           means the OmniTech Minecraft modification, including all
                    Java source code, JSON data files, texture assets, sound
                    assets, model files, shader files, configuration files, and
                    any other file distributed as part of this project.

"The Author"        means David Eichendorf, the original creator and sole
                    copyright holder of The Mod.

"Maintainer"        means any person explicitly listed in CREDITS.md under the
                    "Maintainers" or "Core Developers" heading.

"Modpack"           means a curated collection of Minecraft modifications
                    distributed together as a playable game configuration.

"Integration Patch" means a minimal source-level change made solely to enable
                    compatibility between The Mod and another modification within
                    a Modpack (e.g. adding a cross-mod recipe, adjusting a
                    config default, or registering a fluid mapping).
                    Integration Patches do not include feature additions,
                    rewrites, or standalone releases of The Mod.

"Binary"            means any compiled form of The Mod (e.g. a .jar file).

"Fork"              means any derivative work distributed independently of The
                    Mod, whether under the same or a different identity.

