GRANT OF RIGHTS
================================================================================

Subject to full compliance with all conditions in this license, the Author
grants you the following non-exclusive, non-transferable, royalty-free rights:

  1. MODPACK INCLUSION
     You may include unmodified Binaries of The Mod in a Modpack and distribute
     that Modpack to other players, provided the Modpack is offered free of
     charge to end-users (see PROHIBITED USES, item 3).

  2. INTEGRATION PATCHES
     You may apply Integration Patches to The Mod's source code solely for the
     purpose of making The Mod interoperate with other modifications in your
     Modpack. Any Binary incorporating an Integration Patch must be accompanied
     by the patch's complete corresponding source code, made publicly available
     within 30 days of first distribution under the same terms as this license.

  3. PRIVATE STUDY
     You may read, compile, and run The Mod locally for personal learning and
     research, provided no resulting Binaries are distributed.

