Any exercise of the rights granted above is subject to ALL of the following
conditions. Failure to meet any condition immediately terminates your rights.

  A. ATTRIBUTION
     All distributions of The Mod or any Modpack containing it must include:
       — This license file, unmodified and in full.
       — The CREDITS.md file, unmodified and in full.
       — The copyright notice at the top of this document.

  B. PRESERVATION OF IDENTITY
     You must not alter, remove, or obscure:
       — The mod's registered identifier:  "omnitech"
       — The mod's display name:           "OmniTech"
       — The Java package root:            "com.dev1lroot.mcmods.omnitech"
       — The name, role, or contact of any person listed in CREDITS.md.

  C. SOURCE AVAILABILITY FOR ALTERED BINARIES
     If you distribute a Binary that incorporates any modification to The Mod's
     source code, you must simultaneously make the complete corresponding source
     code of that modified version publicly available at no charge, under the
     same terms as this license, for as long as you distribute the Binary.

  D. NO CLOSED-SOURCE FORKS
     You must not distribute a Fork — in source or Binary form — without making
     the Fork's complete source code publicly available under the same terms as
     this license. Undistributed private Forks are permitted.

